/span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">○ </span><strong><strong>운행노선: [<span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">참조<br></span></strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 0.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">○ <strong><strong>참고사항</strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp; - 통학버스는 이용일 기준 7일 전부터 예약 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ (예시) 예우 시작일을 9.1.로 지정한 경우 통학버스 예약 신청 가능 일자: 8. 25.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 통학버스 운행 노선의 시간은 각 거점&nbsp;출발 시간으로, 이용자는 출발 시간 전까지 출발지에 도착해 있어야 함</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp; - 통학버스 예약 취소는 출발 시간 기준 5분 전까지,&nbsp;최대 5회까지&nbsp;가능함</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 통학버스 부정이용 방지를 위한 조치로 추가 취소가 필요한 경우&nbsp;학생지원팀 통학버스 담당자&nbsp;유선 확인&nbsp;필요&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp; -<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">통학버스 이용 신청: 대구통학버스예약신청-</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">공지사항-</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">발전기금 예우 신청을 통한 대구 ·경북 광역권 통학버스 이용 안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">공지</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"> 참고</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 0.5;\"><br></p><font face=\"돋움\"><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">○</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> <strong>코로나19관련 </strong></span></strong></font></span></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><font face=\"Thread-00004394-Id-0000009f\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"><strong>탑승자 유의사항</strong></span></span></font></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 차량 예약 시 </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">창가 좌석을 우선 예약하여 탑승자 간 거리 두기</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 반드시 </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">마스크 착용 후 탑승</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(미 착용자 탑승 금지)하고 </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">하차 시까지 계속 착용</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 차량 </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">탑승 시 손 소독제를 이용하여 손 소독</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> 실시</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 차량 </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">탑승 중 대화 및 전화 통화 자제하기</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">발열(37.5℃ 이상) 또는 호흡기 증상(인후통, 기침, 근육통, 오한 등) 있는 경우 탑승 금지</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><strong></strong></strong></span></span></span></span></p></font><p style=\"line-height: 0.5;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-